  "description": "The SCOTT Strike 30 delivers a controlled, capable E-Bike performance for riders who want to go further into the mountains without stretching their budget. Engineered for big off-road miles and sustained confidence across all trails, this 150mm full-suspension alloy 29er combines performance and practicality in a well-rounded package.\n\nConfident climbing across switchbacks and long fire roads comes naturally by Bosch's Performance CX motor delivering up to 120Nm of torque and 750W peak output. Paired with an 800Wh removable battery, the bike significantly extends your range and reduces fatigue on longer days—giving you the freedom to explore deeper into the mountains.\n\nSmooth, consistent performance across is delivered through Shimano's Deore 12-speed drivetrain and front and rear suspension with our own proprietary kinematics. The result is a ride that stays composed and predictable wherever you take it—providing the responsiveness and control that makes every trail feel manageable, not just the challenging ones.\n\nRiding modes are easily adjustable through the Bosch App, letting you match your setup to the terrain, your energy, or the demands of the day—whether you're cruising, need additional support, or want to manage your range for a longer adventure. Integrated front and rear lights, a kickstand, and frame mounting points complete the build, making it as ready for the real world as it is for the trail.\n\nThe result is a bike that makes every ride feel effortlessly right. A capable alloy frame and thoughtfully selected components come together in a package that's as comfortable to live with as it is to ride—built for all trails and every adventure that lies ahead.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
